<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll"><head><metadata><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="Tall Story"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="Tall Story (with Guiano)"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="法螺話"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="法螺話 (with Guiano)"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="Guiano"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="RIM"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="理芽"/><amll:meta key="album" value="Tall Story (with Guiano) - Single"/><amll:meta key="album" value="法螺話"/><amll:meta key="album" value="法螺話 (with Guiano) - Single"/><amll:meta key="isrc" value="JPB602098297"/><amll:meta key="ncmMusicId" value="2040000988"/><amll:meta key="qqMusicId" value="0022TtvN38ZlNR"/><amll:meta key="qqMusicId" value="406362097"/><amll:meta key="spotifyId" value="0Ybbi9VQ4g7lavEN4ZTzB1"/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1687473630"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithub" value="174598250"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithubLogin" value="ASyunagi"/></metadata></head><body dur="3:12.360"><div begin="1.390" end="3:12.360"><p begin="1.390" end="7.500" itunes:key="L1" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1.390" end="1.490">ひ</span><span begin="1.640" end="2.110">と</span><span begin="2.110" end="2.310">に</span><span begin="2.310" end="2.740">眠</span><span begin="2.740" end="3.040">る</span><span begin="3.040" end="3.410">も</span><span begin="3.410" end="3.720">の</span> <span begin="4.840" end="4.950">あ</span><span begin="5.090" end="5.480">た</span><span begin="5.480" end="5.730">し</span><span begin="5.730" end="5.910">の</span><span begin="5.910" end="6.010">こ</span><span begin="6.100" end="6.380">こ</span><span begin="6.590" end="6.790">ろ</span><span begin="6.790" end="6.980">の</span><span begin="6.980" end="7.500">中</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">从未与人提及的 埋藏在我内心深处的事</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">從未與人提及的 埋藏在我內心深處的事</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">What lies sleeping within people lies deep inside my heart</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">남들에겐 숨겨 둔 것 내 마음속에 있는 것</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Ce qui sommeille en chacun au fond de mon cœur</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Lo que duerme dentro de la gente está en lo profundo de mi corazón</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Was in den Menschen schlummert tief in meinem Herzen</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Aquilo que dorme nas pessoas está dentro do meu coração</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">То что дремлет в людях таится и в моём сердце</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Ciò che dorme negli altri nel profondo del mio cuore</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Hito ni nemuru mono atashi no kokoro no naka</span></p><p begin="8.240" end="12.820" itunes:key="L2" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="8.240" end="8.920">教</span><span begin="8.920" end="9.030">え</span><span begin="9.140" end="9.350">て</span><span begin="9.350" end="9.560">あ</span><span begin="9.560" end="9.890">げ</span><span begin="9.890" end="10.230">る</span><span begin="10.230" end="10.510">よ</span> <span begin="11.030" end="11.600">君</span><span begin="11.890" end="12.020">だ</span><span begin="12.020" end="12.170">け</span><span begin="12.170" end="12.820">に</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">告诉你哦 只告诉你</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">告訴你哦 只告訴你</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">I&apos;ll tell you about it just you</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">알려 줄게 너에게만</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Je vais te le révéler rien qu’à toi</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Te lo contaré solo a ti</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Ich verrate es dir nur dir allein</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Vou contar só para você</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Я расскажу тебе только тебе</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Te lo dirò solo a te</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Oshiete ageru yo kimi dake ni</span></p><p begin="14.460" end="18.150" itunes:key="L3" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="14.460" end="14.600">あ</span><span begin="14.700" end="14.790">た</span><span begin="14.870" end="15.140">し</span><span begin="15.140" end="15.350">は</span><span begin="15.350" end="15.570">ね</span> <span begin="15.570" end="16.020">実</span><span begin="16.020" end="16.230">は</span><span begin="16.230" end="16.660">人</span><span begin="16.660" end="16.900">殺</span><span begin="16.900" end="17.060">し</span><span begin="17.060" end="17.710">な</span><span begin="17.710" end="17.860">ん</span><span begin="17.860" end="18.150">だ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我呀 其实是个杀人犯</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">我呀 其實是個殺人犯</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">You know I&apos;m actually a murderer</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">나 있잖아 사실은 사람을 죽인 살인자야</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Tu sais en vérité je suis une meurtrière</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Sabes en realidad soy una asesina</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Weißt du ich bin in Wahrheit eine Mörderin</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Sabe eu na verdade sou uma assassina</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Знаешь я на самом деле убийца</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Sai io in realtà sono un’assassina</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Atashi wa ne jitsu wa hitogoroshi nanda</span></p><p begin="18.560" end="21.470" itunes:key="L4" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="18.560" end="18.650">逃</span><span begin="18.770" end="19.210">げ</span><span begin="19.210" end="19.400">る</span><span begin="19.400" end="19.610">な</span><span begin="19.610" end="19.750">ら</span><span begin="19.840" end="20.060">時</span><span begin="20.160" end="20.460">間</span><span begin="20.460" end="20.670">を</span><span begin="20.670" end="20.820">あ</span><span begin="20.920" end="21.320">げ</span><span begin="21.320" end="21.470">る</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">如果要逃跑的话给你时间</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">如果要逃跑的話給你時間</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">If you&apos;re going to run I&apos;ll give you some time</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">도망칠 거라면 시간을 줄게</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Si tu veux fuir je te laisse un peu de temps</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Si quieres huir te daré tiempo</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Wenn du fliehen willst gebe ich dir Zeit</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Se quiser fugir eu te dou algum tempo</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Если хочешь сбежать я дам тебе время</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Se vuoi scappare ti darò un po’ di tempo</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Nigeru nara jikan o ageru</span></p><p begin="21.770" end="25.660" itunes:key="L5" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="21.770" end="22.180">君</span><span begin="22.180" end="23.030">は</span> <span begin="24.760" end="25.150">教</span><span begin="25.150" end="25.240">え</span><span begin="25.380" end="25.660">て</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你准备怎么做呢 告诉我吧</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">你準備怎麼做呢 告訴我吧</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Now you tell me</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">넌 어떻게 할래 말해 줘</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Et toi dis-moi</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Y tú dime</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Und du sag es mir</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">E você me diga</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">А ты скажи мне</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">E tu dimmelo</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Kimi wa oshiete</span></p><p begin="28.200" end="31.130" itunes:key="L6" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="28.200" end="28.340">あ</span><span begin="28.430" end="28.630">た</span><span begin="28.630" end="28.750">し</span><span begin="28.890" end="29.090">き</span><span begin="29.090" end="29.290">っ</span><span begin="29.290" end="29.570">と</span> <span begin="29.920" end="30.030">あ</span><span begin="30.140" end="30.330">た</span><span begin="30.330" end="30.440">し</span><span begin="30.530" end="30.660">い</span><span begin="30.770" end="31.130">ま</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我一定 我现在</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">我一定 我現在</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">I know I do right now</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">나 분명 지금 나는</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Moi sûrement moi maintenant</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Seguro que yo ahora mismo</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Ich glaube ich ich will jetzt</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Eu tenho certeza eu agora</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Я наверняка я прямо сейчас</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Io di sicuro io adesso</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Atashi kitto atashi ima</span></p><p begin="31.630" end="34.610" itunes:key="L7" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="31.630" end="32.070">君</span><span begin="32.070" end="32.180">を</span><span begin="32.260" end="32.470">食</span><span begin="32.470" end="32.590">べ</span><span begin="32.670" end="32.950">ちゃ</span><span begin="32.950" end="33.040">い</span><span begin="33.120" end="33.330">た</span><span begin="33.330" end="33.420">い</span><span begin="33.550" end="33.780">た</span><span begin="33.780" end="33.880">い</span><span begin="33.980" end="34.240">た</span><span begin="34.240" end="34.440">い</span><span begin="34.440" end="34.610">や</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">想把你吃掉呢</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">想把你吃掉呢</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">I wanna eat you eat you eat you up</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">너를 먹어 버리고 싶어어어어</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">J’ai envie de te dévorer dévorer dévorer dévorer</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Quiero devorarte devorarte devorarte no</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Dich auffressen fressen fressen ja</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Quero te devorar devorar devorar ah</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Хочу съесть тебя съесть съесть съесть</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Voglio mangiarti mangiarti mangiarti</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Kimi o tabechaitaitaitaiya</span></p><p begin="35.020" end="39.870" itunes:key="L8" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="35.020" end="35.480">そう</span><span begin="35.480" end="35.560">い</span><span begin="35.560" end="35.830">う</span><span begin="35.950" end="36.180">眼</span><span begin="36.180" end="36.420">を</span> <span begin="36.770" end="36.870">し</span><span begin="36.980" end="37.210">て</span><span begin="37.210" end="37.400">る</span><span begin="37.400" end="37.580">で</span><span begin="37.580" end="37.870">しょ</span> <span begin="38.460" end="38.610">あ</span><span begin="38.700" end="38.870">た</span><span begin="38.870" end="39.160">し</span><span begin="39.160" end="39.330">の</span><span begin="39.610" end="39.870">眼</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">是透露着 这样的神情吧 我的双眼</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">是透露著 這樣的神情吧 我的雙眼</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">My eyes have that kind of look don&apos;t they</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">그런 눈을 하고 있지 내 눈 말이야</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">C’est bien ce regard-là que j’ai pas vrai mes yeux</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Tengo esa mirada verdad estos ojos míos</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">So einen Blick habe ich doch in meinen Augen</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Meus olhos têm esse tipo de olhar não têm</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">У меня ведь именно такой взгляд правда</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Ho quello sguardo vero i miei occhi</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Sou iu me o shiteru desho atashi no me</span></p><p begin="44.470" end="48.460" itunes:key="L9" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="44.470" end="44.920">世</span><span begin="44.920" end="45.130">の</span><span begin="45.130" end="45.510">中</span><span begin="45.510" end="45.760">推</span><span begin="45.850" end="46.170">敲</span><span begin="46.170" end="46.620">さ</span><span begin="46.620" end="46.720">れ</span><span begin="46.850" end="47.040">た</span><span begin="47.040" end="47.590">嘘</span><span begin="47.710" end="47.970">ば</span><span begin="47.970" end="48.140">っ</span><span begin="48.140" end="48.460">か</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">世间尽是经过反复推敲的谎言</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">世間盡是經過反覆推敲的謊言</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">This world is full of carefully polished lies</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">세상은 다듬고 또 다듬은 거짓말뿐이야</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Ce monde n’est rempli que de mensonges soigneusement peaufinés</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">El mundo está lleno de mentiras cuidadosamente pulidas</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Die Welt ist voller sorgsam zurechtgelegter Lügen</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">O mundo está cheio de mentiras cuidadosamente lapidadas</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Весь мир полон тщательно отточенной лжи</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Il mondo è pieno soltanto di bugie ben rifinite</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Yo no naka suikou sareta uso bakka</span></p><p begin="51.110" end="55.250" itunes:key="L10" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="51.110" end="51.780">人</span><span begin="51.780" end="51.980">の</span><span begin="51.980" end="52.210">こ</span><span begin="52.210" end="52.340">と</span><span begin="52.420" end="52.620">な</span><span begin="52.620" end="52.750">ん</span><span begin="52.750" end="52.940">て</span><span begin="53.020" end="53.500">知</span><span begin="53.500" end="53.680">れ</span><span begin="53.680" end="53.860">や</span><span begin="53.860" end="54.050">し</span><span begin="54.150" end="54.460">な</span><span begin="54.460" end="54.560">い</span><span begin="54.560" end="54.870">で</span><span begin="54.960" end="55.250">しょ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">怎么可能将他人看清</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">怎麼可能將他人看清</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">There&apos;s no way you could ever truly know someone</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">남의 마음 따윈 알 수 있을 리 없잖아</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Impossible de vraiment connaître quelqu’un pas vrai</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">No hay forma de conocer de verdad a los demás</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Wie sollte man je einen anderen wirklich kennen</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Não dá para conhecer ninguém de verdade</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Разве можно по-настоящему узнать другого</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Non puoi davvero conoscere gli altri vero</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Hito no koto nante shire ya shinai desho</span></p><p begin="58.000" end="1:02.050" itunes:key="L11" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="58.000" end="58.740">心</span><span begin="58.850" end="59.060">の</span><span begin="59.060" end="59.490">奥</span><span begin="59.490" end="59.620">の</span><span begin="59.620" end="59.830">自</span><span begin="59.920" end="1:00.570">分</span><span begin="1:00.570" end="1:00.760">も</span><span begin="1:00.760" end="1:01.000">知</span><span begin="1:01.000" end="1:01.300">れ</span><span begin="1:01.300" end="1:01.640">ず</span><span begin="1:01.640" end="1:02.050">に</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">连内心深处的自己都无从知晓</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">連內心深處的自己都無從知曉</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">When you don&apos;t even know the self deep inside your own heart</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">마음 깊은 곳의 자신조차 알지 못하면서</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Sans même connaître celle qui se cache au fond de soi</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Si ni siquiera conoces a quien eres en el fondo</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Wo man nicht einmal sich selbst tief im Herzen kennt</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Sem nem conhecer quem você é no fundo do coração</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Если не знаешь даже себя в глубине души</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Se non conosci nemmeno te stessa nel profondo del cuore</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Kokoro no oku no jibun mo shirezu ni</span></p><p begin="1:04.800" end="1:08.940" itunes:key="L12" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:04.800" end="1:05.490">人</span><span begin="1:05.490" end="1:05.620">の</span><span begin="1:05.700" end="1:05.910">こ</span><span begin="1:05.910" end="1:06.160">と</span><span begin="1:06.160" end="1:06.340">な</span><span begin="1:06.340" end="1:06.450">ん</span><span begin="1:06.450" end="1:06.650">て</span><span begin="1:06.740" end="1:07.220">知</span><span begin="1:07.220" end="1:07.420">れ</span><span begin="1:07.420" end="1:07.580">や</span><span begin="1:07.580" end="1:07.760">し</span><span begin="1:07.860" end="1:08.150">な</span><span begin="1:08.150" end="1:08.270">い</span><span begin="1:08.270" end="1:08.540">で</span><span begin="1:08.670" end="1:08.940">しょ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">又怎么可能将他人看清</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">又怎麼可能將他人看清</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">There&apos;s no way you could ever truly know someone</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">남의 마음 따윈 알 수 있을 리 없잖아</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Impossible de vraiment connaître quelqu’un pas vrai</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">No hay forma de conocer de verdad a los demás</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Wie sollte man je einen anderen wirklich kennen</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Não dá para conhecer ninguém de verdade</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Разве можно по-настоящему узнать другого</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Non puoi davvero conoscere gli altri vero</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Hito no koto nante shire ya shinai desho</span></p><p begin="1:26.520" end="1:32.260" itunes:key="L13" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:26.520" end="1:26.630">も</span><span begin="1:26.730" end="1:26.920">ち</span><span begin="1:26.920" end="1:27.320">ろん</span><span begin="1:27.320" end="1:27.790">全</span><span begin="1:27.790" end="1:27.970">部</span><span begin="1:27.970" end="1:28.400">嘘</span><span begin="1:28.400" end="1:28.690">だ</span><span begin="1:28.690" end="1:28.850">よ</span> <span begin="1:29.070" end="1:29.210">あ</span><span begin="1:29.290" end="1:29.460">た</span><span begin="1:29.460" end="1:29.580">し</span><span begin="1:29.580" end="1:29.910">は</span><span begin="1:29.910" end="1:30.300">人</span><span begin="1:30.300" end="1:30.680">生</span><span begin="1:30.760" end="1:31.220">健</span><span begin="1:31.220" end="1:31.610">康</span><span begin="1:31.610" end="1:32.070">少</span><span begin="1:32.070" end="1:32.260">女</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">当然都是骗人的噢 我可是人生健康少女</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">當然都是騙人的噢 我可是人生健康少女</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Of course it&apos;s all a lie I&apos;m a perfectly healthy girl</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">물론 전부 거짓말이야 난 인생 건강 소녀</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Bien sûr tout ça n’est que mensonge moi je suis une fille en pleine santé</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Claro que todo era mentira yo soy una chica perfectamente sana</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Natürlich war das alles gelogen ich bin ein kerngesundes Mädchen</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Claro que tudo isso é mentira eu sou uma garota saudável e cheia de vida</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Конечно всё это ложь я просто здоровая девушка</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Naturalmente è tutta una bugia io sono una ragazza sana e piena di vita</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Mochiron zenbu uso da yo atashi wa jinsei kenkou shoujo</span></p><p begin="1:32.500" end="1:35.690" itunes:key="L14" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:32.500" end="1:32.630">だ</span><span begin="1:32.720" end="1:32.910">け</span><span begin="1:32.910" end="1:33.020">ど</span><span begin="1:33.020" end="1:33.280">さ</span><span begin="1:33.360" end="1:33.800">案</span><span begin="1:33.800" end="1:34.110">外</span> <span begin="1:34.110" end="1:34.200">不</span><span begin="1:34.200" end="1:34.620">思</span><span begin="1:34.620" end="1:34.810">議</span><span begin="1:34.810" end="1:34.950">じゃ</span><span begin="1:35.070" end="1:35.300">な</span><span begin="1:35.300" end="1:35.510">い</span><span begin="1:35.510" end="1:35.690">よ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">不过啊令人意外的是 这并不奇怪噢</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">不過啊令人意外的是 這並不奇怪噢</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">But you know it&apos;s not really that strange</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">하지만 말이야 의외로 이상할 것도 없어</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Mais au fond ce n’est pas si étrange</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Pero pensándolo bien tampoco es tan extraño</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Aber weißt du so seltsam ist das eigentlich gar nicht</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Mas pensando bem nem é tão estranho assim</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Но знаешь в этом нет ничего удивительного</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Eppure sai a pensarci non è poi così strano</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Dakedo sa angai fushigi ja nai yo</span></p><p begin="1:35.930" end="1:39.950" itunes:key="L15" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:35.930" end="1:36.320">神</span><span begin="1:36.320" end="1:36.760">様</span><span begin="1:36.760" end="1:36.950">は</span><span begin="1:36.950" end="1:37.300">人</span><span begin="1:37.300" end="1:37.610">の</span><span begin="1:37.610" end="1:37.840">知</span><span begin="1:37.840" end="1:38.070">っ</span><span begin="1:38.070" end="1:38.190">て</span><span begin="1:38.190" end="1:38.500">る</span><span begin="1:38.500" end="1:38.730">か</span><span begin="1:38.730" end="1:38.960">た</span><span begin="1:38.960" end="1:39.100">ち</span><span begin="1:39.360" end="1:39.450">ば</span><span begin="1:39.590" end="1:39.830">か</span><span begin="1:39.830" end="1:39.950">り</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">神明尽是人们知道的模样</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">神明盡是人們知道的模樣</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">God only ever takes the forms people know</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">신은 언제나 인간이 아는 모습으로만 존재하니까</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Les dieux n’ont jamais que des formes connues des humains</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Dios solo adopta formas que la gente conoce</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Götter haben immer nur Gestalten die Menschen schon kennen</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Deus só assume formas que as pessoas conhecem</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Боги ведь всегда имеют лишь знакомый людям облик</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Dio ha sempre e solo la forma che gli esseri umani conoscono</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Kamisama wa hito no shitteru katachi bakari</span></p><p begin="1:40.200" end="1:42.610" itunes:key="L16" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:40.200" end="1:40.310">つ</span><span begin="1:40.410" end="1:40.650">ま</span><span begin="1:40.650" end="1:40.810">り</span><span begin="1:40.810" end="1:41.460">人</span><span begin="1:41.460" end="1:41.630">の</span><span begin="1:41.710" end="1:42.150">いい</span><span begin="1:42.150" end="1:42.460">よう</span><span begin="1:42.460" end="1:42.610">に</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">说明都是顺着人们的心意</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">說明都是順著人們的心意</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">In other words made to suit what people want</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">그러니까 결국 인간이 원하는 대로</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Autrement dit ils sont façonnés</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Es decir una forma hecha a conveniencia de la gente</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Mit anderen Worten ganz so wie es den Menschen gefällt</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Ou seja conforme a conveniência das pessoas</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Иными словами такой какой людям удобен</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">In altre parole come fa comodo agli esseri umani</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Tsumari hito no ii you ni</span></p><p begin="1:42.790" end="1:46.460" itunes:key="L17" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:42.790" end="1:43.190">作</span><span begin="1:43.190" end="1:43.320">ら</span><span begin="1:43.320" end="1:43.550">れ</span><span begin="1:43.630" end="1:43.840">た</span><span begin="1:43.840" end="1:44.200">人</span><span begin="1:44.200" end="1:44.530">造</span><span begin="1:44.530" end="1:44.930">人</span><span begin="1:44.930" end="1:45.360">間</span><span begin="1:45.360" end="1:45.640">な</span><span begin="1:45.640" end="1:45.770">ん</span><span begin="1:45.770" end="1:45.990">だ</span><span begin="1:45.990" end="1:46.460">よ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">被创造出的人造人噢</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">被創造出的人造人噢</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Just a man-made human being</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">만들어진 인조인간인 거야</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">À la convenance des humains comme des êtres artificiels</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">No es más que un ser humano artificial creado así</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Sind sie künstlich erschaffene Menschen</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">É um ser humano artificial criado por elas</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Они всего лишь искусственные люди созданные нами</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">È un essere artificiale creato da loro</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Tsukurareta jinzou ningen nanda yo</span></p><p begin="1:48.770" end="1:49.640" itunes:key="L18" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:48.770" end="1:48.910">な</span><span begin="1:48.910" end="1:49.200">ん</span><span begin="1:49.200" end="1:49.420">だ</span><span begin="1:49.420" end="1:49.640">よ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">就是这样</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">就是這樣</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">That&apos;s all</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">그런 거야</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Voilà tout</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Eso es</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Genau das sind sie</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">É isso mesmo</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Вот и всё</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Proprio così</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Nanda yo</span></p><p begin="1:53.080" end="1:57.080" itunes:key="L19" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:53.080" end="1:53.520">世</span><span begin="1:53.520" end="1:53.700">の</span><span begin="1:53.700" end="1:54.120">中</span><span begin="1:54.120" end="1:54.370">推</span><span begin="1:54.450" end="1:54.770">敲</span><span begin="1:54.770" end="1:55.200">さ</span><span begin="1:55.200" end="1:55.310">れ</span><span begin="1:55.410" end="1:55.610">た</span><span begin="1:55.610" end="1:56.210">嘘</span><span begin="1:56.290" end="1:56.600">ば</span><span begin="1:56.600" end="1:56.740">っ</span><span begin="1:56.740" end="1:57.080">か</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">世间尽是经过反复推敲的谎言</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">世間盡是經過反覆推敲的謊言</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">This world is full of carefully polished lies</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">세상은 다듬고 또 다듬은 거짓말뿐이야</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Ce monde n’est rempli que de mensonges soigneusement peaufinés</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">El mundo está lleno de mentiras cuidadosamente pulidas</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Die Welt ist voller sorgsam zurechtgelegter Lügen</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">O mundo está cheio de mentiras cuidadosamente lapidadas</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Весь мир полон тщательно отточенной лжи</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Il mondo è pieno soltanto di bugie ben rifinite</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Yo no naka suikou sareta uso bakka</span></p><p begin="1:59.680" end="2:03.810" itunes:key="L20" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:59.680" end="2:00.350">人</span><span begin="2:00.350" end="2:00.560">の</span><span begin="2:00.560" end="2:00.770">こ</span><span begin="2:00.770" end="2:00.910">と</span><span begin="2:01.000" end="2:01.210">な</span><span begin="2:01.210" end="2:01.330">ん</span><span begin="2:01.330" end="2:01.540">て</span><span begin="2:01.650" end="2:02.070">知</span><span begin="2:02.070" end="2:02.260">れ</span><span begin="2:02.260" end="2:02.450">や</span><span begin="2:02.450" end="2:02.630">し</span><span begin="2:02.750" end="2:03.010">な</span><span begin="2:03.010" end="2:03.140">い</span><span begin="2:03.140" end="2:03.520">で</span><span begin="2:03.520" end="2:03.810">しょ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">怎么可能将他人看清</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">怎麼可能將他人看清</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">There&apos;s no way you could ever truly know someone</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">남의 마음 따윈 알 수 있을 리 없잖아</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Impossible de vraiment connaître quelqu’un pas vrai</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">No hay forma de conocer de verdad a los demás</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Wie sollte man je einen anderen wirklich kennen</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Não dá para conhecer ninguém de verdade</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Разве можно по-настоящему узнать другого</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Non puoi davvero conoscere gli altri vero</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Hito no koto nante shire ya shinai desho</span></p><p begin="2:06.550" end="2:10.560" itunes:key="L21" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:06.550" end="2:07.320">心</span><span begin="2:07.420" end="2:07.610">の</span><span begin="2:07.610" end="2:08.040">奥</span><span begin="2:08.040" end="2:08.160">の</span><span begin="2:08.160" end="2:08.400">自</span><span begin="2:08.490" end="2:09.120">分</span><span begin="2:09.120" end="2:09.280">も</span><span begin="2:09.280" end="2:09.560">知</span><span begin="2:09.560" end="2:09.890">れ</span><span begin="2:09.890" end="2:10.210">ず</span><span begin="2:10.210" end="2:10.560">に</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">连内心深处的自己都无从知晓</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">連內心深處的自己都無從知曉</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">When you don&apos;t even know the self deep inside your own heart</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">마음 깊은 곳의 자신조차 알지 못하면서</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Sans même connaître celle qui se cache au fond de soi</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Si ni siquiera conoces a quien eres en el fondo</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Wo man nicht einmal sich selbst tief im Herzen kennt</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Sem nem conhecer quem você é no fundo do coração</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Если не знаешь даже себя в глубине души</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Se non conosci nemmeno te stessa nel profondo del cuore</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Kokoro no oku no jibun mo shirezu ni</span></p><p begin="2:13.400" end="2:17.550" itunes:key="L22" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:13.400" end="2:14.070">人</span><span begin="2:14.070" end="2:14.270">の</span><span begin="2:14.270" end="2:14.480">こ</span><span begin="2:14.480" end="2:14.620">と</span><span begin="2:14.720" end="2:14.890">な</span><span begin="2:14.890" end="2:15.030">ん</span><span begin="2:15.030" end="2:15.240">て</span><span begin="2:15.340" end="2:15.780">知</span><span begin="2:15.780" end="2:15.970">れ</span><span begin="2:15.970" end="2:16.160">や</span><span begin="2:16.160" end="2:16.310">し</span><span begin="2:16.420" end="2:16.680">な</span><span begin="2:16.680" end="2:16.840">い</span><span begin="2:16.840" end="2:17.230">で</span><span begin="2:17.230" end="2:17.550">しょ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">又怎么可能将他人看清</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">又怎麼可能將他人看清</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">There&apos;s no way you could ever truly know someone</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">남의 마음 따윈 알 수 있을 리 없잖아</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Impossible de vraiment connaître quelqu’un pas vrai</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">No hay forma de conocer de verdad a los demás</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Wie sollte man je einen anderen wirklich kennen</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Não dá para conhecer ninguém de verdade</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Разве можно по-настоящему узнать другого</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Non puoi davvero conoscere gli altri vero</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Hito no koto nante shire ya shinai desho</span></p><p begin="2:34.650" end="2:37.760" itunes:key="L23" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:34.650" end="2:34.860">お</span><span begin="2:34.860" end="2:35.000">ば</span><span begin="2:35.080" end="2:35.280">け</span><span begin="2:35.280" end="2:35.440">は</span><span begin="2:35.440" end="2:35.900">人</span><span begin="2:35.900" end="2:36.270">前</span><span begin="2:36.360" end="2:36.530">に</span><span begin="2:36.530" end="2:36.680">し</span><span begin="2:36.760" end="2:36.970">か</span><span begin="2:36.970" end="2:37.200">こ</span><span begin="2:37.430" end="2:37.640">な</span><span begin="2:37.640" end="2:37.760">い</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">鬼怪只出现在人类面前</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">鬼怪只出現在人類面前</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Ghosts only appear when people are there</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">유령은 사람 앞에만 나타나</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Les fantômes n’apparaissent que devant les gens</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Los fantasmas solo aparecen cuando hay alguien delante</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Geister erscheinen nur wenn Menschen da sind</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Fantasmas só aparecem diante das pessoas</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Призраки приходят только когда перед ними есть люди</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">I fantasmi appaiono solo davanti agli esseri umani</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Obake wa hitomae ni shika konai</span></p><p begin="2:38.070" end="2:41.150" itunes:key="L24" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:38.070" end="2:38.500">月</span><span begin="2:38.500" end="2:38.740">は</span><span begin="2:38.740" end="2:38.910">見</span><span begin="2:38.910" end="2:39.130">て</span><span begin="2:39.130" end="2:39.350">る</span><span begin="2:39.350" end="2:39.990">時</span><span begin="2:39.990" end="2:40.210">だ</span><span begin="2:40.210" end="2:40.390">け</span><span begin="2:40.390" end="2:40.740">存</span><span begin="2:40.830" end="2:41.150">在</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">月亮只有在被注视的时候存在</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">月亮只有在被注視的時候存在</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">The moon exists only while you&apos;re looking at it</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">달은 바라보고 있을 때만 존재해</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">La lune n’existe que lorsqu’on la regarde</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">La luna solo existe mientras alguien la mira</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Der Mond existiert nur solange man ihn ansieht</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">A lua só existe enquanto você olha para ela</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Луна существует лишь пока на неё смотрят</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">La luna esiste soltanto quando la guardi</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Tsuki wa miteru toki dake sonzai</span></p><p begin="2:41.480" end="2:44.590" itunes:key="L25" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:41.480" end="2:41.640">そ</span><span begin="2:41.730" end="2:41.880">れ</span><span begin="2:41.880" end="2:42.090">を</span><span begin="2:42.090" end="2:42.550">信</span><span begin="2:42.550" end="2:42.760">じ</span><span begin="2:42.760" end="2:43.070">る</span><span begin="2:43.190" end="2:43.450">か</span><span begin="2:43.450" end="2:43.650">どう</span><span begin="2:43.650" end="2:43.860">の</span><span begin="2:43.860" end="2:44.150">問</span><span begin="2:44.300" end="2:44.590">題</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">问题只在于你是否相信</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">問題只在於你是否相信</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">It&apos;s only a question of whether you believe it</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">그걸 믿느냐 마느냐의 문제야</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Tout dépend seulement de savoir si tu y crois</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Todo depende de si decides creerlo o no</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Es geht nur darum ob du daran glaubst</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">A questão é se você acredita nisso ou não</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Вопрос лишь в том веришь ты в это или нет</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">La questione è se crederci oppure no</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Sore o shinjiru ka dou no mondai</span></p><p begin="2:47.910" end="2:51.810" itunes:key="L26" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:47.910" end="2:48.360">世</span><span begin="2:48.360" end="2:48.570">の</span><span begin="2:48.570" end="2:48.970">中</span><span begin="2:48.970" end="2:49.200">推</span><span begin="2:49.300" end="2:49.530">敲</span><span begin="2:49.610" end="2:50.070">さ</span><span begin="2:50.070" end="2:50.160">れ</span><span begin="2:50.260" end="2:50.460">た</span><span begin="2:50.460" end="2:50.910">嘘</span><span begin="2:51.150" end="2:51.320">ば</span><span begin="2:51.320" end="2:51.570">っ</span><span begin="2:51.570" end="2:51.810">か</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">世间尽是经过反复推敲的谎言</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">世間盡是經過反覆推敲的謊言</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">This world is full of carefully polished lies</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">세상은 다듬고 또 다듬은 거짓말뿐이야</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Ce monde n’est rempli que de mensonges soigneusement peaufinés</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">El mundo está lleno de mentiras cuidadosamente pulidas</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Die Welt ist voller sorgsam zurechtgelegter Lügen</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">O mundo está cheio de mentiras cuidadosamente lapidadas</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Весь мир полон тщательно отточенной лжи</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Il mondo è pieno soltanto di bugie ben rifinite</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Yo no naka suikou sareta uso bakka</span></p><p begin="2:54.520" end="2:58.740" itunes:key="L27" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:54.520" end="2:55.200">人</span><span begin="2:55.200" end="2:55.340">の</span><span begin="2:55.420" end="2:55.560">こ</span><span begin="2:55.640" end="2:55.770">と</span><span begin="2:55.860" end="2:56.060">な</span><span begin="2:56.060" end="2:56.170">ん</span><span begin="2:56.170" end="2:56.350">て</span><span begin="2:56.480" end="2:56.950">知</span><span begin="2:56.950" end="2:57.120">れ</span><span begin="2:57.120" end="2:57.310">や</span><span begin="2:57.310" end="2:57.510">し</span><span begin="2:57.590" end="2:57.800">な</span><span begin="2:57.800" end="2:57.860">い</span><span begin="2:58.000" end="2:58.270">で</span><span begin="2:58.370" end="2:58.740">しょ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">怎么可能将他人看清</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">怎麼可能將他人看清</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">There&apos;s no way you could ever truly know someone</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">남의 마음 따윈 알 수 있을 리 없잖아</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Impossible de vraiment connaître quelqu’un pas vrai</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">No hay forma de conocer de verdad a los demás</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Wie sollte man je einen anderen wirklich kennen</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Não dá para conhecer ninguém de verdade</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Разве можно по-настоящему узнать другого</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Non puoi davvero conoscere gli altri vero</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Hito no koto nante shire ya shinai desho</span></p><p begin="3:01.400" end="3:05.500" itunes:key="L28" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:01.400" end="3:02.170">心</span><span begin="3:02.290" end="3:02.440">の</span><span begin="3:02.440" end="3:02.920">奥</span><span begin="3:02.920" end="3:03.070">の</span><span begin="3:03.070" end="3:03.270">自</span><span begin="3:03.360" end="3:03.970">分</span><span begin="3:03.970" end="3:04.160">も</span><span begin="3:04.160" end="3:04.410">知</span><span begin="3:04.410" end="3:04.720">れ</span><span begin="3:04.720" end="3:05.060">ず</span><span begin="3:05.060" end="3:05.500">に</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">连内心深处的自己都无从知晓</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">連內心深處的自己都無從知曉</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">When you don&apos;t even know the self deep inside your own heart</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">마음 깊은 곳의 자신조차 알지 못하면서</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Sans même connaître celle qui se cache au fond de soi</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Si ni siquiera conoces a quien eres en el fondo</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Wo man nicht einmal sich selbst tief im Herzen kennt</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Sem nem conhecer quem você é no fundo do coração</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Если не знаешь даже себя в глубине души</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Se non conosci nemmeno te stessa nel profondo del cuore</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Kokoro no oku no jibun mo shirezu ni</span></p><p begin="3:08.270" end="3:12.360" itunes:key="L29" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:08.270" end="3:08.910">人</span><span begin="3:08.910" end="3:09.100">の</span><span begin="3:09.100" end="3:09.250">こ</span><span begin="3:09.350" end="3:09.480">と</span><span begin="3:09.590" end="3:09.750">な</span><span begin="3:09.750" end="3:09.870">ん</span><span begin="3:09.870" end="3:10.040">て</span><span begin="3:10.180" end="3:10.640">知</span><span begin="3:10.640" end="3:10.810">れ</span><span begin="3:10.810" end="3:10.910">や</span><span begin="3:11.000" end="3:11.170">し</span><span begin="3:11.300" end="3:11.500">な</span><span begin="3:11.500" end="3:11.630">い</span><span begin="3:11.710" end="3:11.980">で</span><span begin="3:12.070" end="3:12.360">しょ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">又怎么可能将他人看清</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">又怎麼可能將他人看清</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">There&apos;s no way you could ever truly know someone</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">남의 마음 따윈 알 수 있을 리 없잖아</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Impossible de vraiment connaître quelqu’un pas vrai</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">No hay forma de conocer de verdad a los demás</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Wie sollte man je einen anderen wirklich kennen</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Não dá para conhecer ninguém de verdade</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Разве можно по-настоящему узнать другого</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Non puoi davvero conoscere gli altri vero</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Hito no koto nante shire ya shinai desho</span></p></div></body></tt>